silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_03_training_pipeline_law_sections_04_adapter_specialization_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'AdapterSpecializationConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the governed Mittens individual — the domestic cat at the Tartu Animal Clinic whose annual vet exam on 2026-05-18 produced the evidence chunk c-0x7f4a; also, clinical care plan record 77 at Tartu clinic: receives universal-mediator from Mittens apex but not from storage row — concrete proof of strict Hom inclusion." .
